# Contains CROPS OF THIRD-PARTY REFERENCE PLATES (reference/images/curated/**).
# CLAUDE.md permanent constraint: those must NEVER be committed or published, and
# a crop derived from one is derived from it. The repo .gitignore covers
# `reference/` and `shots/` but NOT `tools/tmp/**`, so `git add tools/tmp` would
# ship them. This file is the only thing standing between that and a public repo.
*
!.gitignore
